==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|lykill}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*lukilaz}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|is|/ˈlɪːcɪtl/}}
* {{rhymes|is|ɪːcɪtl|s=2}}

===Noun===
{{is-noun|@@}}

# a [[key]]
#: {{ux|is|Ekki gleyma '''lyklunum''' þegar þú ferð út.|Don't forget '''the keys''' on your way out.}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég hef þrjá '''lykla''' og [[tyggjó]] í vasanum.|I have three '''keys''' and some [[gum]] in my pocket.}}
# {{lb|is|music}} a [[clef]]
# {{lb|is|computing}} a [[key]]; one of several small, usually square buttons on a typewriter or computer keyboard
#: {{syn|is|takki|hnappur}}
# {{lb|is|cryptography}} a [[cryptographic key]], a [[key]]
# {{lb|is|botany}} [[primula]], [[primrose]] {{gloss|plant of the genus {{taxfmt|Primula|genus}}}}

